# --- Regularization-set images (task 5.7, ADR 0008) ---
# Regenerable from ml/reg/comic_character/manifest.json's recorded
# seeds/prompts; no LFS configured in this repo and R2 is Phase 12 by
# CLAUDE.md §0.1's own rule, so the images themselves aren't committed —
# only the manifest (force-added) and the derived DINOv2 embedding bank
# (ml/identity/reg_embeddings/) are.
ml/reg/*.jpg
ml/reg/*.txt
ml/reg/**/*.jpg
ml/reg/**/*.txt

